---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { SALES_EMAIL, COMPANY, CVR, ADDRESS } from '../site';
---

<Legal
  title="Privacy policy · CAN Data Extract"
  heading="Privacy policy"
  description={`How ${COMPANY} handles personal data on candataextract.com and in CAN Data Extract.`}
  updated="2026-10-16"
>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    {COMPANY} (CVR {CVR}), {ADDRESS.join(', ')},
    is the data controller for the personal data described here. Contact us at
    <a href={`mailto:${SALES_EMAIL}`}>{SALES_EMAIL}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>This website</h2>
  <p>
    candataextract.com is a static website. It sets no cookies and runs no analytics. Your
    browser stores your light or dark theme choice locally; it is never sent to us. The site is
    hosted on GitHub Pages, which logs IP addresses for security purposes.
    <span class="todo">TODO: confirm hosting and any analytics before publishing</span>
  </p>

  <h2>CAN Data Extract accounts</h2>
  <p>When you sign in to app.candataextract.com we process:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your name and email address from Google, Microsoft Entra ID or the account you create.</li>
    <li>Session and device data needed to keep you signed in.</li>
    <li>The traces, transforms, collections and simulator configs you upload or create.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><span class="todo">TODO: legal basis, retention periods, sub-processors, hosting location</span></p>

  <h2>Traces and vehicle data</h2>
  <p>
    Traces can contain a vehicle identification number (VIN), which may be personal data when it
    can be linked to a person. Who can see your traces depends on your plan; see the
    <a href="/terms/">terms of service</a> and <a href="/pricing/">pricing</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under the GDPR you have the right to access, correct, delete and export your personal data,
    and to object to or restrict its processing. Write to <a href={`mailto:${SALES_EMAIL}`}>{SALES_EMAIL}</a>.
    You can complain to the Danish Data Protection Agency (Datatilsynet).
  </p>
</Legal>
